{"data": [{"created_at": "2026-10-27T12:34:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115059667886051761"], "id": "2115059667886051761", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 9872, "like_count": 93, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "不要试图想去叫醒甚至拯救他们\n他们的行为\n配得上他们所受的苦难\n\n尊重他人命运", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115059667886051761"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T12:21:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115056359817572805"], "id": "2115056359817572805", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1764818331822182400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 1602, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115056354771763247", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "要想让大模型写出真正舒服易读的文章，就必须反向干预它的“机器方言”\n\n主动要求其“拆解长难句、补充从句引导词、保留必要的介词与过渡、禁用冷门生造名词”，把原本服务于代码和推理的高压文本，重新翻译成符合人脑认知节奏的人类语言。\n\n详细：https://t.co/hnyW8h3j8V\n\n论文：https://t.co/0N0OAHdmRe", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115056359817572805"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115042835196227584"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:21:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115056354771763247"], "id": "2115056354771763247", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 68, "impression_count": 7192, "like_count": 74, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 27, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "很多时候读AI生成的回答，哪怕内容完全正确，读上几段就会觉得异常疲惫、喘不过气。\n\n来自纽约大学和德克萨斯大学奥斯汀分校的语言学研究人员，通过对 14 个主流大模型与人类真实文本的横向对比，揭示了这种“心累感”背后的真正元凶：\n\n前沿AI模型正在系统性地过度使用 6 https://t.co/99R4gOqtJQ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115056354771763247"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114964748492226562"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T06:18:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114964898992250899"], "id": "2114964898992250899", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 5018, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114729813886067111", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "搞了个片头\n感觉还不错...\n\n☺️ https://t.co/Gam8HBLcIJ https://t.co/Zq0fBizsHP", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114964898992250899"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114913820716204032"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T05:43:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114956091905962195"], "id": "2114956091905962195", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1764818331822182400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2907, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114956089192247393", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "至于隐私安全问题\n\n官方称接入了蚂蚁统一安全管理体系，采用授权密钥与智能体分离托管机制。\n\nAI智能体在调用各项跨应用、跨服务能力时，并不直接接触底层账号的核心授权密钥。 https://t.co/PV03y1B20J", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114956091905962195"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114913341009522688", "3_2114913492646203392"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T05:43:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114956089192247393"], "id": "2114956089192247393", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1764818331822182400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3983, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114956086436581433", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "还能帮你盯演唱会门票和B站UP主更新\n\n真是普通人很需要的个人Agent了 https://t.co/BTLhfK551Q", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114956089192247393"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114913077187731456", "3_2114913108842127360"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T05:43:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114956086436581433"], "id": "2114956086436581433", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1764818331822182400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 3162, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114956083517329906", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "甚至还能连接各种智能家居、硬件和车辆，控制这些设备... https://t.co/5quJ5hOMLC", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114956086436581433"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114912236372471808", "3_2114913182586441728"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T05:43:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114956083517329906"], "id": "2114956083517329906", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 60, "impression_count": 30920, "like_count": 81, "quote_count": 15, "reply_count": 62, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "国内个人Agent战斗要开始打响了\n\n蚂蚁集团旗下的灵光APP宣布发布2.0版本\n升级为「个人AI助理」\n\n能更主动、持续跟进和管理生活中的复杂事务，我进行了简单的体验\n\n它不仅可以连接一些国内的第三方服务，如飞书、支付宝、钉钉、滴滴打车等\n\n还能根据你的需求主动去搜索接入公开的MCP/CLI... https://t.co/uL4MYzi2Wi", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114956083517329906"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114927484458393600"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:50:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114927689945727444"], "id": "2114927689945727444", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1764818331822182400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 28, "impression_count": 2421, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114927687571825122", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Unlimited OCR 在 HuggingFace 上下载量累计超 1000 万，Github 上已获得 2.83万 stars\n\nHuggingFace：https://t.co/91Xz7U0ltW\n\nGithub：https://t.co/xAH990zPaD\n\n一口气读完三体，约1200+页 https://t.co/YeX68KCVsY", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114927689945727444"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114924771624538112"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:50:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114927687571825122"], "id": "2114927687571825122", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1764818331822182400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2843, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114927684325437876", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "最后还有个小彩蛋\n\nUnlimited OCR Works 的名字，借用了日本知名游戏和动画《Fate/stay night》里的一个招式名：“无限剑制”（Unlimited Blade Works）。在作品中，这个招式能展开一个布满刀剑的空间，使用前还有一段经典台词。\n\n第一代模型发布后，一位社区用户把这段台词改成了 OCR 版本： https://t.co/vxjiqYR7TF", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114927687571825122"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114924692444430337"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:50:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114927684325437876"], "id": "2114927684325437876", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1764818331822182400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1461, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114927681435513245", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "它还会把厚文档分成几部分，处理到哪里，就主要保留哪里需要的信息，把暂时用不上的旧缓存释放掉\n\n在测试中，这部分缓存占用的显存从 47GB 降到了 1.77GB https://t.co/cbfGPUI9EK", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114927684325437876"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114924592003424256"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:50:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114927681435513245"], "id": "2114927681435513245", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1764818331822182400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1575, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114927678898032954", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "处理厚文档时，第二代也更省计算、更省显存\n\n模型把文档转成文字，需要一小段一小段地生成。在约 100 页文档的指定测试中，第二代每生成一小段内容，速度约为第一代的 5.6 倍。 https://t.co/sLg9fpCeE8", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114927681435513245"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114924494590738432"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:50:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114927678898032954"], "id": "2114927678898032954", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1764818331822182400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2306, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114927676201054710", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "从测试结果看，第二代处理长文档的能力有了明显提升。\n在同一套多页文档测试中，第一代得了 61.89 分，第二代提高到 84.59 分。\n\n测试既看文字有没有认对，也看翻页后的段落和表格能不能接好、内容顺序有没有排乱\n\n团队还准备了 100 份厚文档，每份 103–300 页。第二代在这套更难的测试中得了 77.06 https://t.co/YzgjsLXfHz", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114927678898032954"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114923639984525312"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:50:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114927676201054710"], "id": "2114927676201054710", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1764818331822182400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 2794, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114927673894199611", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "原理是：人类在抄书时，视线只集中在眼前正在抄写的段落和前后几行，无需随时在脑海中死记硬背整本书的所有字词。模型同理，只将当前正在解析的内容及临近上下文保留在活跃的高密度计算窗口内，避免注意力计算无节制消耗硬件资源。 https://t.co/FMFjB0kHKQ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114927676201054710"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114926817014669312"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:50:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114927673894199611"], "id": "2114927673894199611", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 537, "impression_count": 50803, "like_count": 463, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 34, "retweet_count": 49}, "text": "OCR 模型出现吞金兽了\n\n文心 Unlimited OCR 第二代发布\n从连续解析几十页，升级到直接能把3600页哈利波特七部全吞了\n\n将文档解析的处理上限从数十页推向“无限”\n\n第二代的Unlimited OCR引入 Unlimited-Horizon Decoding Paradigm，无限跨度解码机制： https://t.co/KY0Deiz4YW", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114927673894199611"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T17:33:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114772521560187091"], "id": "2114772521560187091", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1764818331822182400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2112, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114772517504389331", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "原文：https://t.co/TcyZr6PSOD", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114772521560187091"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114772508948021248"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:33:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114772517504389331"], "id": "2114772517504389331", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 10925, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "卧槽\n微软要干掉6万人？\n\n微软 10 月 26 日在官方博客上宣布了一项\"自愿离职计划\"（Voluntary Exit Offer）…\n\n包括Xbox、Windows、Copilot、财务等团队的员工可以自愿申请主动离职，拿取一次性补偿\n\n符合条件的员工超过6万人…\n\n根据工龄可一次性领取现金：8 到 39 周基本工资…\n\n副总裁级（内部职级 https://t.co/oFOrOWevAz", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114772517504389331"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114729062925230081"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:44:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114729813886067111"], "id": "2114729813886067111", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 11605, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114727411501965371", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "调了下\n\n这次有点像新闻联播了\n哈哈哈哈\n\nClaude Code制作，大部分时间花在了脚本调整上\n依然还没有解决配音问题\n主要是我周末去改版网站了... https://t.co/vDR5arqSzR https://t.co/6rZ8n39b09", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114729813886067111"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T14:34:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114727411501965371"], "id": "2114727411501965371", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 25, "impression_count": 13344, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "就算用Claude帮我做一期视频\n还是要花费非常多的时间\n\n主要是在脚本上\n\n其他都能自动化，但是要做成真的让人愿意看的还是要下很大的功夫，但是对于那些已经熟练制作过很多视频的人来说可能会很方便\n\n这也是这篇文章要说的\n\n133 位专利律师实验：同样使用 AI，老手得到增强，新人面临认知卸载", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114727411501965371"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T13:15:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114707372828684395"], "id": "2114707372828684395", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1764818331822182400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2543, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114707251206225921", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Anthropic：董事会批准了一项框架，规定每当股价上涨50%时，即可向公益基金增发最多相当于总股本2%的N类股份。", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114707372828684395"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T13:14:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114706975615508817", "2114707251206225921"], "id": "2114707251206225921", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 17611, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 23, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114705510830375081", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Anthropic正式提交纳斯达克IPO申请，股票代码为“ANT”\n\n根据披露的信息：Anthropic上半年营收163亿美元，上年同期为12亿美元。\n\n截至2026年6月30日的六个月，Anthropic净亏损为807亿美元，称未来可能无法实现或维持盈利。\n\n根据SpaceXAI相关安排，在延续至2029年的期限内，合计支出将最高达1205亿美元。 https://t.co/eu67xzA6hw", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114707251206225921"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T13:07:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114705510830375081"], "id": "2114705510830375081", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 29, "impression_count": 56814, "like_count": 149, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 51, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "预计 Anthropic 将在提交IPO后的第二天，发布全新一代的大模型 Fable 5.5\n\n该模型将在你话还没说完的情况下就知道你要干啥...\n\n以往所有的提示词和技能约束将失效...\n\n因为仅通过自然语言模型已经完全理解你要干啥🫡", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114705510830375081"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T08:20:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114632585049784479", "2114633309250805788"], "id": "2114633309250805788", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 46, "impression_count": 20931, "like_count": 94, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 30, "retweet_count": 12}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113014142600953868", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "卧槽\n\n博主入侵了他的三星电视，发现了电视机会常开其麦克风\n\n它会自动进行内容识别、地理定位、网络映射、广告定向和用户画像抓取分析\n\n同时电视机会把这些数据与三星的“400个合作伙伴”共享\n\n更恐怖的是： https://t.co/6a8bcwx9cq", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114633309250805788"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2115042835196227584", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2114964748492226562", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2114913820716204032", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114913341009522688", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114913492646203392", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114913077187731456", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114913108842127360", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114912236372471808", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114913182586441728", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2114927484458393600", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2114924771624538112", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114924692444430337", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114924592003424256", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114924494590738432", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114923639984525312", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2114926817014669312", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2114772508948021248", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2114729062925230081", "type": "video"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2115059667886051761", "next_token": "7140dibdnow9c7btwp0g7604eg7ubzg288kwpo9q8gt2x", "oldest_id": "2114633309250805788", "result_count": 23}}